### RH HMS API examples (VS Code "REST Client" extension or copy into Postman)
@base = http://localhost:4000/api/v1

### 1. Register a patient (OTP is printed in the server console when SMTP is not configured)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test Patient", "email": "test@example.com", "phone": "+94771234567", "password": "Str0ng!Pass" }

### 2. Verify OTP
POST {{base}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@example.com", "code": "123456" }

### 3. Login (seeded demo patient)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "patient@example.com", "password": "Staff@12345" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Doctors, filters and live slots
GET {{base}}/doctors?dept=cardiology&lang=si
###
GET {{base}}/doctors/d1/slots?date=2026-11-16
###
GET {{base}}/doctors/d1/earliest

### 5. Book an appointment (logged in)
POST {{base}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "doctorId": "d1", "date": "2026-11-16", "time": "09:15", "type": "VIDEO", "reason": "Follow-up" }

### 6. Guest booking (no login)
POST {{base}}/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "doctorId": "d6", "date": "2026-11-17", "time": "08:00", "name": "Walk In", "phone": "+94771112233" }

### 7. My appointments / records / health card
GET {{base}}/appointments/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
###
GET {{base}}/patients/me/records
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
###
GET {{base}}/patients/me/health-card
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Pay an invoice (PayHere sandbox form fields)
POST {{base}}/billing/invoices/INVOICE_ID/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Emergency ambulance request (public) and tracking
POST {{base}}/ambulance/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{ "callerName": "Kamal", "phone": "+94771234567", "address": "45 Galle Road, Colombo 03", "lat": 6.9, "lng": 79.85 }
###
GET {{base}}/ambulance/track/AMB-00000

### 10. AI Doc
POST {{base}}/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lang": "en", "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "What are the pharmacy hours?" }] }

### 11. Live queue board
GET {{base}}/queue/colombo
